content.text:
The root cause is one fault: ts-travel-plan-service's outgoing HTTP calls to ts-train-service had their method rewritten. Its user-facing endpoints then return 500 and ts-ui-dashboard shows the errors.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_response_body_corrupted",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.span_name AS caller_span, c.attr_http_response_status_code AS caller_code, s.service_name AS callee, s.span_name AS callee_span, s.attr_http_request_method AS callee_method, s.attr_http_response_status_code AS callee_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id = c.span_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "In abnormal period, travel-plan GET calls to train-service arrive as PATCH /error and return 405, 1219 times."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.span_name AS caller_span, c.attr_http_request_method AS method, c.attr_http_response_status_code AS code, count(*) AS n FROM normal_traces c JOIN normal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id = c.span_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Client' AND s.service_name='ts-train-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "In normal period the same travel-plan GET calls to train-service are GET requests returning 200."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_http_response_status_code AS code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name LIKE 'POST /api/v1/travelplanservice%' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Travel-plan's user-facing travelPlan endpoints return HTTP 500 for the affected requests in the abnormal period."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_http_response_status_code AS code, count(*) AS n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE 'POST /api/v1/travelplanservice%' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard's travelPlan requests return 500 with multi-second latency, matching travel-plan's failures."}]}
  ]
}
```

